OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUS rapper postpones O2 arena show
OL,4,Aafter Manchester evacuation
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I just wanna make sure everyone is
OL,7,Fsafe and the next show goes on
OL,8,Fproperly. My heart and prayers are with
OL,9,Fwith everyone that was injured last
OL,10,Fnight."
OL,12,FOne person was taken to hospital and
OL,13,Fmore than 80 were assessed for "eye and
OL,14,Frespiratory symptoms" after the
OL,15,Fincident during Toliver's show at the
OL,16,FCo-op Live arena on Sunday night.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
